      "content": "i don't want to just \"exist\" and wait for more decay. it feels like i'm just prolonging a funeral for a person who isn't even dead yet. there's no peace in just sitting here in the dust, watching myself disappear bit by bit. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... let the void take over? instead of this slow, pathetic fading away?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
